{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And mottled.</b> From the root of ערי מקלט (cities of refuge)." "<b>As a freewill offering you may make it.</b> For this is not a blemish on account of a missing limb." "<b>But for a vow it shall not be accepted.</b> For when he vows, he knows that he did not vow something defective. And some say it with astonishment: would you make it a freewill offering? But for a vow it shall not be accepted — for it is a blemish."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:14:25.184520842Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}